{title: Elangaathu Veesudhe}
{artist: Ilaiyaraaja Sriram Parthasarathy Shreya Ghoshal}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm] eLangaathu veesudhey isai,        [F] poala paesudhey
[Dm] vaLaiyaadha moongilil,        [C] raagam [Dm] vaLainchu oadudhey
[C] maegham [Dm] muzhichu kaetkudhey,        [Dm] karum paaRai manasula mayil
[F] thoagai virikkudhey,        [Dm] mazhai chaaral theLikkudhey
[C] pul veLi [Dm] paadhai virikkudhey,        [C] vaanavil [Dm] kudaiyum pudkudhey
[C] pul veLi [Dm] paadhai virikkudhey,        [C] vaanavil [Dm] kudaiyum pulkudhey
[Dm] maNiyin oasai kaettu mana,        [F] kadhavu thiRakkudhey
[Dm] puthiya thaaLam poattu udal,        [F] kaatril midhakkudhey
[F] pinni pinni chinna eLaiyoadum,        [F] nenjai aLLum vaNNa thuNi poalao
[Dm] NNukkoNNu dhaan iNanchi irukkuu,        [Dm] Ravu yellaam amanchi irukku
[F] aLLi aLLi thandhu uRavaadum,        [F] annamadi indha nilam poala
[Dm] silarukku dhaan manasu irukku,        [Dm] ulagam adhil nilaichu irukku
[Dm] nae [C] thu thanimaiyila poachu,        [Dm] yaa [C] rum thuNai illai
[Dm] yaa [C] ro vazhi thuNaikku vandhaal,        [Dm] yae [C] dhum iNai illa
[Dm] iulagathil edhuvum thanichu illaiyae,        [Dm] kuzhalil [C] raagam malaril
[F] vaasam saerndhadhu [A] poala
